      "content": "thanks. i tried looking on the site but it's a bit confusing. like, do i need a specific reference number for the lamp itself or can i just give the intersection? also, if it's a recurring issue every day at the same time, does that change how they prioritize it? it feels like more than just a bulb dying since it's so predictable.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
